{
  "enabled": true,
  "ha_url": "http://YOUR_HOME_ASSISTANT_IP:8123",
  "ha_token": "PASTE_LONG_LIVED_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE",
  "entities": ["switch.living_room"],
  "sensitivity": 7,
  "boost": 1.5,
  "dbl_max": 0.6,
  "cooldown": 1.2,
  "_comment": "Copy to /opt/birdthing/clap.json (NEVER commit the real token). A double clap calls <domain>.toggle on every entity in `entities` (switch.* or light.*). sensitivity 1-10 = how easily a clap triggers; boost 1-8 = gain for a quiet/far mic; dbl_max = max seconds between the two claps; cooldown = quiet seconds after a toggle. All of these are editable live from the dashboard Clap page (Settings -> Clap control)."
}
